# Classic (map tab) background from a screenshot of the stock cockpit (620 x 272, the owner's
# manual's "Connection manager" page). Dials are placed on the car's dial positions
# (rev counter centre 205,386, speedometer 1235,386, radius 128: symmetric about the screen centre
# x 720, 2026-11-24; the first estimate from phone photos was 190/1220), the bars on the tab bar and
# bottom bar areas. The picture itself is not in the repository: save it as skins/classic.png.
image classic.png
#      src x y w h          dest x y w h          shape feather
layer  18 136 116 116       77 258 256 256        circle 7
layer  490 136 116 116      1107 258 256 256      circle 7
layer  185 22 260 28        436 37 568 61         rect 10
layer  195 222 225 34       596 463 491 74        rect 10
